Subject: [PATCH] Mac Edit: mask badge on timeline clips; Claude's mask notice
 line with Undo in the chat

A clip with a mask (Invert noted), green-screen key or cut-out shows a small icon on its
timeline block; clicking selects it and scrolls to Mask & green screen. Claude's mask changes
show one line with Undo (the session's own undo) in the Edit Claude panel and the one-Claude panel.

